        "Background": "Saspar looks like a cold servant of the Order of Chaos, but underneath he simply doesn't care whether he lives; he quietly hopes to fail at his work and so be done with existence. His magic comes from strange enchanted devices rather than study: a gun that fires spells once loaded with the right bullet, and an ornate pocket watch that lets him foresee events and head off danger. He always wears a red sash over his eyes, and nobody knows whether he's truly blind."
