      "fields": {
        "Background": "Saspar: Lines in Full\n-2 Unique Weakness (Cannot Detect Things Perceptible to Sight Alone)\n\nSaspar: Attacks\nBrim Shot (Affinity: Fire; Perks: Accurate x2, Effective, Ranged; Flaws: Activation, Weapon): Calls on the spirit of Phoenix to fire a homing projectile bathed in fire.\nIse Shot: Calls on the spirit of Ymir to fire a frost ray that encapsulates what it hits in ice.\nLode Shot (Affinity: Earth; Perks: Effective, Ranged, Stunning; Flaws: Activation, Weapon): Calls on the spirit of Gaia to fire a rocky blast that knocks targets off their feet.\n\nSaspar: Character Hooks\nThe Order of Chaos makes Saspar and Acacia natural enemies for anyone defending the world from evil -- Fukiko and Auren, whose backgrounds both feature a vague darkness to be fought, fit especially well. They can also serve as magical rivals."
      }
